title: "Evidence at Human Scale: Reference Architecture for Accountable Decisions in Agentic Systems"
type: software
version: "1.0.0-rc.1"
date-released: "2026-11-23"
authors:
  - family-names: Georgi
    given-names: Andy
repository-code: "https://github.com/andygeorgi/evidence-at-human-scale"
abstract: >-
  A reference architecture, documentation contracts, a synthetic worked example and
  evaluation guidance for accountable decisions in agentic systems. Systems produce
  evidence, AI makes it consumable, and people remain accountable. This is a release
  candidate and an architecture proposition, not a deployment or benefit claim. No
  evaluation has been run, and the example checks do not establish truth, compliance,
  production safety or business value.
keywords:
  - accountable decisions
  - agentic systems
  - decision support
  - evidence provenance
  - human oversight
  - reference architecture
